  Prioritization Signal
                                                                                                                                                                                  
  The 4.2h fill time is primarily driven by Outreach & Confirmation (waiting on nurse responses) and Matching (coordinator decision time). The 7% mismatch points directly at
  Credential Verification quality. The 12% no-show rate suggests Availability Tracking is unreliable — if availability data were accurate, no-show risk would drop.               
                  
